  "id": "31/G",
  "goal": "Explain how somatosensory, haptic, smell, and taste senses can shape and be simulated in XR immersion.",
  "achieves": "Provides the learner with the foundation to recognize the non-visual and non-auditory channels available for XR immersion and their technical limitations, supporting the course aim of understanding and implementing XR systems with confidence."
